# 301 redirects from old domain to new domain.
# Covers both protocols (http/https) and www/non-www variants.
# The `!` at the end forces the redirect even if a matching file exists.
# :splat captures the wildcard path so /projects/comi-app, etc. all redirect to the same page on the new domain.

http://beniyorohan-design.com/*       https://beniyorohan.design/:splat  301!
https://beniyorohan-design.com/*      https://beniyorohan.design/:splat  301!
http://www.beniyorohan-design.com/*   https://beniyorohan.design/:splat  301!
https://www.beniyorohan-design.com/*  https://beniyorohan.design/:splat  301!
